{
  "name": "Post-eval gate: score a draft, publish only after human approval",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post-eval gate (original, mirrors `skills/00-post-eval`)\nPOST a draft -> 100-point rubric (20/25/20/15/20) -> hard gates (no link caps proof at 10; over-length fails) -> instant JSON verdict.\nIf the score >= `threshold` (default 70) the approver gets an email with **Approve / Skip**. Approved drafts go to a `publish_queue` sheet. The *Publish to X* node ships **disabled**: enable it only if you want approved posts to go out automatically.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "ad48f5eb-3c30-5f6c-8470-1f066ac10563",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "post-eval",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5d16a047-9122-5d07-a96c-6f0aa04f920c",
      "name": "Draft webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "86e5be80-2e0a-5185-8952-b8ae9e2acb70"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f58772d4-a767-50ea-a85b-36c84bedd6c8",
